{"strongs": "H6999", "word": "קָטַר", "translit": "qa.tar", "root": "קטרת", "morph": "H:V", "pos": "verb denominative Pi`el Hiph`il", "gloss": "make sacrifices smoke, send them up in smoke", "definition": "[ קָטַר ] 115 verb denominative Pi`el Hiph`il make sacrifices smoke, send them up in smoke (properly produce קְטֹרֶת , see Sta ZAW vi (1886), 298 f. ); — Pi`el 42 Perfect 3 masculine plural קִטְּרוּ Jer 19:13 +, קִטַּרְתֶּם Jer 44:21 ; Jer 44:23 Imperfect 3 masculine singular יְקַטֵּר Hab 1:16 +; 3 masculine plural יְקַטֵּר֑וּן Hos 11:2 , etc.; Infinitive absolute קַטֵּר 1Sam 2:16 +; construct Jer 11:13 +, Participle plural מְקַטְּרִים Isa 65:3 +, etc.; — make sacrifices smoke , offer them by burning : to ׳ י , 1Sam 2:16 (where probably read יְקַטְּרוּן [and so v 1Sam 2:15 ] Sta l.c. 299 ): elsewhere to other gods or in illegal worship, Jer 44:23 with accusative קִטֵּר (but see this, below) Jer 44:21 (here [and al. in some other passages] of incense ), תּוֺדָה Amos 4:5 place is usually with ב , e.g. כַּבָּמוֺת 2Kgs 17:11 ; 2Kgs 23:5 עוֺד הָעָם מְוַבְּחִים וּמְקַטְּרִים בַּבָּמוֺת 1Kgs 22:44 ; 2Kgs 12:4 ; 2Kgs 14:4 ; 2Kgs 15:4 ; 2Kgs 15:35 ( R ), compare 2Kgs 16:4 = 2Chr 28:4 (compare RS Sem.i. 471; 2nd ed. 490 ); אֲשֶׁר ׳ הַבּ קִטְּרוּ שָׁמָּה 2Kgs 23:8 with עַל e.g. על הגבעות Hos 4:13 , על גג(ו)ת Jer 19:13 ; Jer 32:29 , על הלבנים Isa 65:3 , על ההרים v Isa 65:7 with לְ of deity, Hos 11:2 ; Jer 1:16 + 14 t. Jeremiah (+ Jer 19:13 ; Jer 32:29 above), Hab 1:16 ; 2Kgs 22:17 ; 2Kgs 23:5 ; 2Chr 25:14 ; 2Chr 28:25 ; 2Chr 34:25 Qr (> Kt Hiph`il ), to the brazen serpent 2Kgs 18:4 . Pu`al Participle ׳ מְקֻטֶּרֶת מֹר וגו Song 3:6 fumigated with myrrh , etc. ( Aq ᵑ9 Schlottm מִקְּטֹרֶת ). Hiph`il n Perfect 3 masculine singular הִקְטִיר Lev 9:10 +; 2 masculine singular הִקְטַרְתָּ Exod 29:13 ; Exod 29:18 ; Exod 29:25 , etc.; Imperfect 3 masculine singular יַקְטִיר Lev 4:26 ; Lev 16:25 ; Exod 40:27 +, etc.: Imperative masculine singular הַקְטֵר 2Kgs 16:15 Infinitive absolute הַקְטֵיר 1Kgs 9:25 construct לְהַקְטִיר Exod 30:20 +; Participle מַקְטִיר Jer 33:18 +, etc. 1. make sacrifices smoke , usually \\ \\ a. in worship of ׳ י : absolute 1Kgs 12:33 ; 1Kgs 13:1 ; 2Chr 29:11 with accusative חלב Lev 17:6 ; Num 18:17 ; 1Sam 2:15 ; 1Sam 2:16 , עלת 2Kgs 16:13 ; 2Kgs 16:15 ; 2Chr 13:11 , אִשֶּׁה Exod 30:20 ; Lev 2:11 ; Num 18:17 , מנחה Jer 33:18 ראֹשׁ , etc., Lev 8:20 אַזְכָּרָה Lev 2:16 , חלבי השׁלמים Lev 6:5 קטרת 1Sam 2:28 on 1Kgs 9:25 see Klo Benz ; place is על מזבח Lev 4:10 + 5 t., הַמִוְבֵּ֫חָה Exod 29:13 ; Exod 29:18 ; Exod 29:25 + 23 t. Leviticus, Num 5:26 (all P ); with הַמִּזְבֵּחַ (accusative) Lev 6:8 בַּבָּמוֺת 1Kgs 3:3 בגיא בן הִנֹּם 2Chr 28:3 . \\ \\ b. less often in worship of other gods, לאלהין (gods of Solomon's wives) 1Kgs 11:8 , לאלהיו (of Moab) Jer 48:35 , להם (Baalim) Hos 2:15 — 2Chr 34:25 read Qr Qal. 2. cause incense to smoke, offer incense absolute 2Chr 2:5 ; 2Chr 26:18 (twice in verse); 2Chr 26:19 with עַל of altar 2Chr 26:16 ; Exod 30:7 ; Exod 40:27 with accusative יַקְטִירֶנָּה Exod 30:7 ; Exod 30:8 , קטרת סמים Exod 30:7 ; Exod 40:27 ; 2Chr 2:3 , קטרת תמיד Exod 30:8 , קטרת ׳ הק Num 17:5 ; 2Chr 29:7 . 3. make smoke upon ( על ) both altars (of burnt-offering and of incense) 1Chr 6:34 , compare also 1Chr 23:13 . Hoph`al be made to smoke as a sacrifice: Imperfect 3 feminine singular תָּקְטָ֑ר Lev 6:15 , Participle מֻקְטָר Mal 1:11 ( Ew Ke and others [ Ges «GKC:121b»§ 121b ]; We Now read לִשְׁמִי מִנְחָה ׳ מ ; but see מֻקְטָר ).", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB7407')\">BDB7407</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H6999')\">H6999</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB7406')\">BDB7406</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB7408')\">BDB7408</entry></div><p> [<bdbheb>קָטַר</bdbheb>]<sub>115</sub> <b>verb denominative Pi`el Hiph`il</b> <highlightword>make sacrifices smoke, send them up in smoke</highlightword> (properly <highlight>produce</highlight> <bdbheb>קְטֹרֶת</bdbheb>, see <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sta')\">Sta<sup>ZAW vi (1886), 298 f.</sup></lookup>); — <div class=\"point\"><b>Pi`el</b><sub>42</sub> <highlight>Perfect</highlight> 3 masculine plural <bdbheb>קִטְּרוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 19:13\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(24,19,13)\">Jer 19:13</ref> +, <bdbheb>קִטַּרְתֶּם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 44:21\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"44\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"44\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(24,44,21)\">Jer 44:21</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 44:23\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"44\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"44\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(24,44,23)\">Jer 44:23</ref> <highlight>Imperfect</highlight> 3 masculine singular <bdbheb>יְקַטֵּר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Hab 1:16\" b=\"35\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(35,1,16)\">Hab 1:16</ref> +; 3 masculine plural <bdbheb>יְקַטֵּר֑וּן</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Hos 11:2\" b=\"28\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(28,11,2)\">Hos 11:2</ref>, etc.; <highlight>Infinitive absolute</highlight> <bdbheb>קַטֵּר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Sam 2:16\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(9,2,16)\">1Sam 2:16</ref> +; <highlight>construct</highlight> <ref ref=\"Jer 11:13\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(24,11,13)\">Jer 11:13</ref> +, <highlight>Participle</highlight> plural <bdbheb>מְקַטְּרִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 65:3\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"65\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"65\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(23,65,3)\">Isa 65:3</ref> +, etc.; — <highlight>make sacrifices smoke</highlight>, offer them by burning : to <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb>, <ref ref=\"1Sam 2:16\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(9,2,16)\">1Sam 2:16</ref> (where probably read <bdbheb>יְקַטְּרוּן</bdbheb> [and so v<ref ref=\"1Sam 2:15\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(9,2,15)\">1Sam 2:15</ref>] <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sta')\">Sta<sup>l.c. 299</sup></lookup>): elsewhere to other gods or in illegal worship, <ref ref=\"Jer 44:23\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"44\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"44\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(24,44,23)\">Jer 44:23</ref> with accusative <bdbheb>קִטֵּר</bdbheb> (but see this, below) <ref ref=\"Jer 44:21\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"44\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"44\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(24,44,21)\">Jer 44:21</ref> (here [and al. in some other passages] of <highlight>incense</highlight>), <bdbheb>תּוֺדָה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Amos 4:5\" b=\"30\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(30,4,5)\">Amos 4:5</ref> place is usually with <bdbheb>ב</bdbheb>, e.g. <bdbheb>כַּבָּמוֺת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Kgs 17:11\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(12,17,11)\">2Kgs 17:11</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 23:5\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(12,23,5)\">2Kgs 23:5</ref> <bdbheb>עוֺד הָעָם מְוַבְּחִים וּמְקַטְּרִים</bdbheb> <bdbheb>בַּבָּמוֺת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Kgs 22:44\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"44\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"44\" onclick=\"bcv(11,22,44)\">1Kgs 22:44</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 12:4\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(12,12,4)\">2Kgs 12:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 14:4\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(12,14,4)\">2Kgs 14:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 15:4\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(12,15,4)\">2Kgs 15:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 15:35\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"35\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"35\" onclick=\"bcv(12,15,35)\">2Kgs 15:35</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('R')\"><reflink>R</reflink></lookup>), compare <ref ref=\"2Kgs 16:4\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(12,16,4)\">2Kgs 16:4</ref> = <ref ref=\"2Chr 28:4\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(14,28,4)\">2Chr 28:4</ref> (compare <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('RS')\">RS<sup>Sem.i. 471; 2nd ed. 490</sup></lookup>); <bdbheb>אֲשֶׁר</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>הַבּ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>קִטְּרוּ שָׁמָּה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Kgs 23:8\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(12,23,8)\">2Kgs 23:8</ref> with <bdbheb>עַל</bdbheb> e.g. <bdbheb>על הגבעות</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Hos 4:13\" b=\"28\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(28,4,13)\">Hos 4:13</ref>, <bdbheb>על גג(ו)ת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 19:13\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(24,19,13)\">Jer 19:13</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 32:29\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(24,32,29)\">Jer 32:29</ref>, <bdbheb>על הלבנים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 65:3\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"65\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"65\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(23,65,3)\">Isa 65:3</ref>, <bdbheb>על ההרים</bdbheb> v<ref ref=\"Isa 65:7\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"65\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"65\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(23,65,7)\">Isa 65:7</ref> with <bdbheb>לְ</bdbheb> of deity, <ref ref=\"Hos 11:2\" b=\"28\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(28,11,2)\">Hos 11:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 1:16\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(24,1,16)\">Jer 1:16</ref> + 14 t. Jeremiah (+<ref ref=\"Jer 19:13\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(24,19,13)\">Jer 19:13</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 32:29\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(24,32,29)\">Jer 32:29</ref> above), <ref ref=\"Hab 1:16\" b=\"35\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(35,1,16)\">Hab 1:16</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 22:17\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(12,22,17)\">2Kgs 22:17</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 23:5\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(12,23,5)\">2Kgs 23:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Chr 25:14\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(14,25,14)\">2Chr 25:14</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Chr 28:25\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(14,28,25)\">2Chr 28:25</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Chr 34:25\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"34\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"34\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(14,34,25)\">2Chr 34:25</ref> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Qr')\"><reflink>Qr</reflink></lookup> (&gt;<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Kt')\"><reflink>Kt</reflink></lookup> <b>Hiph`il</b>), <highlightword>to the brazen serpent</highlightword> <ref ref=\"2Kgs 18:4\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(12,18,4)\">2Kgs 18:4</ref>. <b>Pu`al</b> Participle <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מְקֻטֶּרֶת מֹר וגו</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Song 3:6\" b=\"22\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(22,3,6)\">Song 3:6</ref> <highlight>fumigated with myrrh</highlight>, etc. (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Aq')\"><reflink>Aq</reflink></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Vg')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵑ9</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Schl')\">Schlottm</lookup> <bdbheb>מִקְּטֹרֶת</bdbheb>). <b>Hiph`il</b><sup>n</sup> <highlight>Perfect</highlight> 3 masculine singular <bdbheb>הִקְטִיר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Lev 9:10\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(3,9,10)\">Lev 9:10</ref> +; 2 masculine singular <bdbheb>הִקְטַרְתָּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 29:13\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(2,29,13)\">Exod 29:13</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 29:18\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(2,29,18)\">Exod 29:18</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 29:25\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(2,29,25)\">Exod 29:25</ref>, etc.; <highlight>Imperfect</highlight> 3 masculine singular <bdbheb>יַקְטִיר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Lev 4:26\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(3,4,26)\">Lev 4:26</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 16:25\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(3,16,25)\">Lev 16:25</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 40:27\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"40\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"40\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(2,40,27)\">Exod 40:27</ref> +, etc.: <highlight>Imperative</highlight> masculine singular <bdbheb>הַקְטֵר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Kgs 16:15\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(12,16,15)\">2Kgs 16:15</ref> <highlight>Infinitive absolute</highlight> <bdbheb>הַקְטֵיר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Kgs 9:25\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(11,9,25)\">1Kgs 9:25</ref> <highlight>construct</highlight> <bdbheb>לְהַקְטִיר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 30:20\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(2,30,20)\">Exod 30:20</ref> +; <highlight>Participle</highlight> <bdbheb>מַקְטִיר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 33:18\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(24,33,18)\">Jer 33:18</ref> +, etc. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <highlight>make sacrifices smoke</highlight>, usually <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> in worship of <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb>: absolute <ref ref=\"1Kgs 12:33\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"33\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"33\" onclick=\"bcv(11,12,33)\">1Kgs 12:33</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Kgs 13:1\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(11,13,1)\">1Kgs 13:1</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Chr 29:11\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(14,29,11)\">2Chr 29:11</ref> with accusative <bdbheb>חלב</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Lev 17:6\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(3,17,6)\">Lev 17:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 18:17\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(4,18,17)\">Num 18:17</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Sam 2:15\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(9,2,15)\">1Sam 2:15</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Sam 2:16\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(9,2,16)\">1Sam 2:16</ref>, <bdbheb>עלת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Kgs 16:13\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(12,16,13)\">2Kgs 16:13</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 16:15\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(12,16,15)\">2Kgs 16:15</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Chr 13:11\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(14,13,11)\">2Chr 13:11</ref>, <bdbheb>אִשֶּׁה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 30:20\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(2,30,20)\">Exod 30:20</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 2:11\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(3,2,11)\">Lev 2:11</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 18:17\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(4,18,17)\">Num 18:17</ref>, <bdbheb>מנחה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 33:18\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(24,33,18)\">Jer 33:18</ref> <bdbheb>ראֹשׁ</bdbheb>, etc., <ref ref=\"Lev 8:20\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(3,8,20)\">Lev 8:20</ref> <bdbheb>אַזְכָּרָה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Lev 2:16\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(3,2,16)\">Lev 2:16</ref>, <bdbheb>חלבי השׁלמים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Lev 6:5\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(3,6,5)\">Lev 6:5</ref> <bdbheb>קטרת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Sam 2:28\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"28\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"28\" onclick=\"bcv(9,2,28)\">1Sam 2:28</ref> on <ref ref=\"1Kgs 9:25\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(11,9,25)\">1Kgs 9:25</ref> see <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Klo')\">Klo</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Benz')\">Benz</lookup>; place is <bdbheb>על מזבח</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Lev 4:10\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(3,4,10)\">Lev 4:10</ref> + 5 t., <bdbheb>הַמִוְבֵּ֫חָה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 29:13\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(2,29,13)\">Exod 29:13</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 29:18\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(2,29,18)\">Exod 29:18</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 29:25\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(2,29,25)\">Exod 29:25</ref> + 23 t. Leviticus, <ref ref=\"Num 5:26\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(4,5,26)\">Num 5:26</ref> (all <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>); with <bdbheb>הַמִּזְבֵּחַ</bdbheb> (accusative) <ref ref=\"Lev 6:8\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(3,6,8)\">Lev 6:8</ref> <bdbheb>בַּבָּמוֺת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Kgs 3:3\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(11,3,3)\">1Kgs 3:3</ref> <bdbheb>בגיא בן הִנֹּם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Chr 28:3\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(14,28,3)\">2Chr 28:3</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> less often in worship of other gods, <bdbheb>לאלהין</bdbheb> (gods of Solomon's wives) <ref ref=\"1Kgs 11:8\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(11,11,8)\">1Kgs 11:8</ref>, <bdbheb>לאלהיו</bdbheb> (of Moab) <ref ref=\"Jer 48:35\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"48\" vBegin=\"35\" cEnd=\"48\" vEnd=\"35\" onclick=\"bcv(24,48,35)\">Jer 48:35</ref>, <bdbheb>להם</bdbheb> (Baalim) <ref ref=\"Hos 2:15\" b=\"28\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(28,2,15)\">Hos 2:15</ref> — <ref ref=\"2Chr 34:25\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"34\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"34\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(14,34,25)\">2Chr 34:25</ref> read <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Qr')\"><reflink>Qr</reflink></lookup> </div><div class=\"point\"><b>Qal. 2.</b> <highlight>cause incense to smoke, offer incense</highlight> absolute <ref ref=\"2Chr 2:5\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(14,2,5)\">2Chr 2:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Chr 26:18\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(14,26,18)\">2Chr 26:18</ref> (twice in verse); <ref ref=\"2Chr 26:19\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(14,26,19)\">2Chr 26:19</ref> with <bdbheb>עַל</bdbheb> of altar <ref ref=\"2Chr 26:16\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(14,26,16)\">2Chr 26:16</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 30:7\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(2,30,7)\">Exod 30:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 40:27\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"40\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"40\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(2,40,27)\">Exod 40:27</ref> with accusative <bdbheb>יַקְטִירֶנָּה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 30:7\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(2,30,7)\">Exod 30:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 30:8\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(2,30,8)\">Exod 30:8</ref>, <bdbheb>קטרת סמים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 30:7\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(2,30,7)\">Exod 30:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 40:27\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"40\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"40\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(2,40,27)\">Exod 40:27</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Chr 2:3\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(14,2,3)\">2Chr 2:3</ref>, <bdbheb>קטרת תמיד</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 30:8\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(2,30,8)\">Exod 30:8</ref>, <bdbheb>קטרת</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>הק</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Num 17:5\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(4,17,5)\">Num 17:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Chr 29:7\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(14,29,7)\">2Chr 29:7</ref>. </div><div class=\"poi